Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.65,0:01:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这就是犹太陀螺的由来{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And that's the story of the dreidel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.28,0:01:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有些人说圣诞树源自古埃及{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Now, Some people trace the Christmas tree back to the Egyptians...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.37,0:01:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}在每年白昼最短的日子  他们会把棕榈枝带进屋里{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...who'd bring palm branches into huts on the shortest day of the year...{\r}
