Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.38,0:01:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}大家好  乔伊  怎么了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, you guys. Hey. What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不出门不行啊  吉宁在房间到处拉筋折腾{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I had to get out of the apartment. Janine's stretching all over the place.{\r}
