Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.65,0:02:10.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我好喜欢她{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I like her so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.86,0:02:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}可惜她对你没感觉{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Aw, I'm sorry sweetie that she doesn’t feel the same way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.90,0:02:14.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}就是啊  她好可爱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I know. And she's so sweet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.86,0:02:18.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我好想喂她吃葡萄  帮她梳头{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I just want to feed her grapes and brush her hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.58,0:02:22.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你知道她不是猴子吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You are aware that she's not a monkey, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.83,0:02:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我已经对吉宁没感觉了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I am so over Janine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.55,0:02:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我原来觉得她火辣性感  但现在  没这回事了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I mean, Yeah, at first I thought she was hot, but now she's like old news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.18,0:02:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们好  吉宁{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, guys. Janine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.10,0:02:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我刚接到除夕特别节目的通告{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm gonna be a dancer on a TV special for New Year's Eve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.39,0:02:46.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}叫什么狄克摇滚狄奇之夜的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's called some sort of Dickin' Rockin' Dicky Eve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.27,0:02:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}慢着{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hold it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.19,0:02:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是《狄克克拉克新年摇滚之夜》吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Are you talking about Dick Clark's New Year's Rockin' Eve?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.90,0:02:56.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那不是我说的吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, that's what I said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.33,0:03:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}天哪  我们爱死那个节目了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, my God, we love that show!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}从我有记忆以来  罗斯和我每年都看{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ross and I have been watching it since I can remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.67,0:03:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}内心深处的你还是个小胖妹  对吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ah, you're still just a little fat girl inside, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我今年要去  我要当狂欢派对来宾{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well I'm gonna be on it this year. I'm gonna be one of the party people.{\r}
