Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.85,0:03:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}明天就要录影了  我也不太懂{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well actually they're taping tomorrow. I don't understand why--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}流程是这样的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, how it works is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.52,0:03:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}时代广场的部分是现场直播{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...the part with Dick Clark in Times Square is actually live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.57,0:03:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但他们会预录狂欢派对的画面{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But they tape some of the party stuff ahead of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}知道的人并不多{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, Not a lot of people know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们也想去吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Do you guys want to come too?{\r}
